      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791466290,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Ambulance routes to closest hospital: Mayo Hospital (6 min transit)\n2. Unchecked Ground Reality: Cath Lab busy & NEDOCS Level-6 overcrowding\n3. Result: 45 min hallway offload delay + 0 available angioplasty slots\n4. Triggers secondary inter-hospital transfer: 3.8 to 4.7 hours delay\n\u26a0\ufe0f FATAL OUTCOME / EXTENSIVE MYOCARDIAL INFARCTION",
      "fontSize": 11,
